### List
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/relservice/Orderdetails

### Read with items
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/relservice/Orderdetails?$expand=Item_comp

### Create (deep insert)
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/relservice/Orderdetails
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Handler Test Order",
  "Item_comp": [
    { "product": "Desk", "quantity": 3 }
  ]
}

### Update (replace the ID)
PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/relservice/Orderdetails(169e8dfa-b33b-4ec2-bb86-1a6d1df0d87b)
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Updated by handler" }

### Delete
DELETE http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/relservice/Orderdetails(c1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111)